OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 80, hit by car and dies at
OL,4,Asupermarket
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 80-year-old woman has died after she
OL,7,Fwas hit by a car in a supermarket car
OL,8,Fpark.
OL,10,FPolice were called just after 12:00 BST
OL,11,Fto a report of a grey Kia Soul
OL,12,Fcolliding with two pedestrians and
OL,13,Fseveral other parked and moving
OL,14,Fvehicles in the Morrisons car park on
OL,15,FWalpole Road in Gosport, Hampshire.
OL,17,FThe woman was pronounced dead at the
OL,18,Fscene and a second pedestrian had minor
OL,19,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
